.superpowers/
# Agent scratch space, same class as .superpowers/. Untracked content here
# makes `git status --porcelain` non-empty, which makes build.rs stamp every
# release binary `<commit>-dirty` -- and a dirty stamp is REFUSED by the
# cutover-arm validator for live mode (and is a red provenance gate).
.agents/
/target
# WAL side-files: the fixture db is production-schema (journal_mode=WAL),
# so read-only opens regenerate these transiently. Never the fixture itself.
fixtures/*.db-shm
fixtures/*.db-wal
.claude/worktrees/
.worktrees/
__pycache__/
